WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.064 --> 00:00:14.976
Since wedding-parent makeup is part of preparing for a major event — your child's wedding — you should always check the cancellation and refund policy before confirming your booking.

2
00:00:15.312 --> 00:00:27.408
Weddings especially can face unexpected changes or cancellations, so it's worth getting the relevant policy explained in advance in case plans change.

3
00:00:27.744 --> 00:00:43.080
There have been reports of unlicensed freelancers, advertising through Instagram or blogs, taking a deposit with no business registration and then going silent or simply not showing up — a costly "no-show" that leaves clients out of pocket.

4
00:00:43.416 --> 00:00:54.192
To avoid this risk, always confirm that the shop holds a proper cosmetology business license and is a registered business that can issue cash receipts.

5
00:00:54.528 --> 00:01:06.720
Rather than just chasing a low price, choosing a trustworthy specialist with a clear cancellation and refund policy is the sure way to turn anxiety about this precious day into confidence.

6
00:01:07.056 --> 00:01:17.568
Taking the small effort to carefully note practical details like payment amounts and account information will serve as solid insurance protecting a memory that lasts a lifetime.
